#==============================================================================================
#
#   animatable - Animations::Animatable: an element's animations and transitions state
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Animations/Animatable.cpp (lines 1-301): animate(), the relevant
#       animations of an element, associating animations with it, its CSS-defined animations
#       per pseudo-element, its registered transitions and their attributes, and visit_edges.
#       Region r43 took the state ahead of phase 4, because StyleComputer::compute_style_impl
#       asks every element for these and the layout tree is built from computed styles; region
#       p4a ported the rest (animate's keyframes come from script, phase 3).
